      "updated": 1759934946175,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Create \".env\"-file in project folder and inside it\nadd Azure App Service (Web App), Default\nDomain (URL). The frontend needs an URL to\nthe Az Backend to be able to fetch with a\nDTO-requestfrom the FormUI. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Create \".env\"-file in project folder and inside it add Azure App Service (Web App), Default Domain (URL). The frontend needs an URL to the Az Backend to be able to fetch with a DTO-requestfrom the FormUI. ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
